<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-6185] Keyboard shortcut should not work in text input</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-6185</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When I create dynamic text input and put &apos;l&apos; character it is not entered in the text field and it is working as keyboard short cut which is &quot;show/hide line numbers&quot;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;notebook example:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;

&lt;p&gt;%jdbc&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;select * from users where email = ${Email=}&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment>&lt;p&gt;chrome browser&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;jdbc interpreter&lt;/p&gt;</environment>
