                            <comment id="17949632" author="reamer" created="Tue, 6 May 2025 06:26:55 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hi &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=soonoh&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;soonoh&quot;&gt;soonoh&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
I cannot reproduce the behavior. Can you please provide a step by step guide to reproduce the behavior.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thanks&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17949933" author="JIRAUSER309494" created="Wed, 7 May 2025 08:50:51 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;1. run zeppelin using docker:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
% docker run -p 8081:8080 --rm --name zeppelin-012 apache/zeppelin:0.12.0&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2. open chrome browser and go to &quot;http://localhost:8081&quot;&lt;br/&gt;
3. create a test notebook, adding text input and run the notebook&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
%python
print(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;Output=&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, z.input(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;Text&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;Hello, World!&quot;&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;4. type &quot;l&quot; in the text field, it is not entered into the text field and it is worked as shortcut.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;attached a screencast video file&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17949935" author="reamer" created="Wed, 7 May 2025 09:02:30 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Many thanks for the video. This makes reproduction very easy.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I am surprised that Zeppelin reacts at all to such simple characters as &apos;l&apos;. Perhaps we should implement the shortcuts of the classic frontend.&lt;br/&gt;
 &lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/13076399/13076399_screenshot-1.png&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Most shortcuts are executed in combination with Crtl. What do you think?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17956217" author="JIRAUSER309494" created="Thu, 5 Jun 2025 01:04:36 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;You&apos;re right.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;However we need to fix this bug ASAP.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We can re-implement it sooner or later as combination with control or shift key.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17958324" author="reamer" created="Tue, 10 Jun 2025 06:42:18 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Closed with &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/4925&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/4925&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
